  "verdicts": [
    {
      "id": "C1",
      "verdict": "confirmed",
      "reason": "The logged URL is built with urlencode including 'key': self._api_key, so the API key is written to the INFO log, breaking R1.",
      "evidence": ["app/weather.py:19", "app/weather.py:20"],
      "severity": "blocking"
    },
    {
      "id": "C2",
      "verdict": "confirmed",
      "reason": "The test only asserts 'city=Lyon' is in caplog.text and never checks that 'fake-key-0000' is absent, so it passes while the key is being logged.",
      "evidence": ["tests/test_weather.py:12", "tests/test_weather.py:15"],
      "severity": "consider"
    }
  ]
}
```
